ht>appearance, sight, vision</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 8:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,4)\">Num 8:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> in general <highlight>what is seen</highlight>, <bdbheb>עֵינָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 11:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,11,3)\">Isa 11:3</ref> i.e. what his outward eyes see (compare <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,7)\">1Sam 16:7</ref> <b>1</b> b), <bdbheb>עֵינֶיהָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לִמ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,16)\">Ezek 23:16</ref>, <bdbheb>עְינֶיךָ אֲשֶׁר תִּרְאֶה</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 28:34\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,34)\">Deut 28:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:67\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"67\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"67\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,67)\">Deut 28:67</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְכָלמֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עֵינֵי הַכֹּהֵן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 13:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,12)\">Lev 13:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> specifically <highlight>a.</highlight> (supernatural) <highlight>vision</highlight> (in Ezekiel, Daniel; often accusative of congnate meaning with verb with <bdbheb>ראה</bdbheb>): <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,4)\">Ezek 8:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,24)\">Ezek 11:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"3\" 